## Codex items 7 & 8

**Item 7 — report ↔ candidate SHA**  
For `dressed-candidate`, the viewer loads raw text, hashes it with `crypto.subtle` (SHA-256 hex), fetches `/reports/somerville-dressed-report.json`, and copies `staticReconstruction` / `motionContinuity` into in-memory `doc.somerville.acceptance` only when `report.candidateSha256` matches. Embedded acceptance in the JSON is stripped for those fields first so a stale PASS in the file is never shown. With no candidate file or a report without a matching hash (current report has no `candidateSha256`), status stays **未驗證**. Tube checks still run once at load; **`report.valid === false` overrides** a matched static PASS on the header badge.

**Item 8 — wording & framing**  
Option label: **整理後靜態候選** (was 穿衣). Front/rear/side no longer reset core framing to full rope; only the **全繩取景** button restores `savedFull` target/scale. **核心** still calls `frameCore`; core view direction uses the front offset while keeping the core target.

